<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal C/A deficit 192 bln esc in Jan-Feb.</title>
<headline>Portugal C/A deficit 192 bln esc in Jan-Feb.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal had an accumulated</p>
<p>current account deficit of 192.4 billion escudos between January</p>
<p>and February after a deficit of 160.8 billion in the same</p>
<p>period of 1996, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>(Figures in billions of escudos)</p>
<p>			 Jan-Feb 97    Jan-Feb 96     Feb 97    Feb 96</p>
<p>    C/A balance	-192.4	 -160.8	 -151.0     -117.7</p>
<p> Goods		   -345.6	 -292.1	 -173.9     -145.4</p>
<p>    Services	    -16.9	  -10.0	   -8.6	 -4.8</p>
<p>Foreign investment</p>
<p>    in Portugal	 -207.8	-304.6	  -279.9     -44.3</p>
<p>Portuguese investment</p>
<p>    abroad		-317.3	-211.9	   -121.0   -317.7</p>
<p>-- Lisbon editorial +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
